# ---- 行尾归一：仓库内一律 LF ----
# 本机 core.autocrlf=true，若不显式锁定行尾，gradlew 会以 CRLF 入库，
# Linux 侧（CI / 别人的开发机）会报 "bad interpreter: No such file or directory"。
* text=auto eol=lf

# ---- 二进制：禁止任何行尾转换 ----
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.so binary
*.dex binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
*.img binary
*.zip binary

# Windows 批处理必须保持 CRLF，否则 goto / 标签跳转可能失效
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
